      "versionNonce": 634520,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "ORCHESTRATION \u2014 Dagster (software-defined assets)\ndlt assets  \u2192  @dbt_assets (one Dagster asset auto-generated per dbt model)  \u2192  dbt tests as asset checks\n`dagster dev` locally   \u00b7   webserver + daemon in Docker Compose on a GCP e2-micro VM   \u00b7   daemon holds the daily schedule\nGitHub Actions builds and deploys the image; UI reached over an IAP tunnel (ingress is IAP-only)",
      "originalText": "ORCHESTRATION \u2014 Dagster (software-defined assets)\ndlt assets  \u2192  @dbt_assets (one Dagster asset auto-generated per dbt model)  \u2192  dbt tests as asset checks\n`dagster dev` locally   \u00b7   webserver + daemon in Docker Compose on a GCP e2-micro VM   \u00b7   daemon holds the daily schedule\nGitHub Actions builds and deploys the image; UI reached over an IAP tunnel (ingress is IAP-only)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "dagster",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
