      "text": "Solid = data flow   \u00b7   Dashed = control / validation   \u00b7   Raw zone makes every downstream step replayable\nELT over ETL: warehouse compute is elastic and transformations stay re-runnable without re-ingesting",
      "originalText": "Solid = data flow   \u00b7   Dashed = control / validation   \u00b7   Raw zone makes every downstream step replayable\nELT over ETL: warehouse compute is elastic and transformations stay re-runnable without re-ingesting",
